WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.959
Welcome to DBL Group's TalentHub!

2
00:00:04.079 --> 00:00:08.360
As CHRO, the big hiring
decisions come to you.

3
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:13.320
In this video we'll see how to
decide a requisition sent to you,

4
00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:16.040
how to sign a Hiring Approval Sheet,

5
00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:21.600
and how your signature goes onto offer and
appointment letters. Let's get started!

6
00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:27.617
The role is group-wide, granted on Access
Control. Requisitions inside the system,

7
00:00:27.737 --> 00:00:33.830
sheets by email link. The menu has
Requisitions, Candidates, Talent Bank,

8
00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:38.510
Approval Sheets, and the
Configuration pages, for every unit.

9
00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:45.300
Sign in with your DBL email
and password. Once down the menu:

10
00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:51.260
Requisitions, every unit's.
Candidates and Talent Bank, the pipelines.

11
00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:56.530
Approval Sheets, the state of sent sheets.
Under Configuration: Approval Paths,

12
00:00:56.650 --> 00:01:00.050
Unit Config, AI Settings, Board Groups.
And Employees, the directory.

13
00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:02.670
The first decision.
When Head of Talent Acquisition

14
00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:07.170
clicks Send to CHRO on the final level,
you are told. Open the requisition

15
00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:12.810
and the Approvals tab shows the whole
chain, with your level at the end.

16
00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:19.680
Details has section A, Job Analysis
has Factory HR's section B and the JD,

17
00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:24.920
and back on Details, the facility
requirements. All in one place.

18
00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:30.830
Your four buttons. Approve, the
requisition is Approved. Reject, it ends.

19
00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:35.910
Need more info, back to the raiser.
And Send to Board.

20
00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:41.900
Need more info requires a remark;
the requisition goes back to the raiser,

21
00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:47.740
and when they fix and resend, the chain
restarts from the first level and ends

22
00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:53.380
with you again. Reject is final, with a
reason; the raiser has to raise it afresh.

23
00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:58.330
Send to Board: pick the members,
one click from a Board Group.

24
00:01:59.170 --> 00:02:03.610
A Board level is appended and each
member is emailed a personal link.

25
00:02:04.370 --> 00:02:09.090
The first answer decides.
Links last fourteen days.

26
00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:13.720
A glimpse of what a board member sees:
the requisition's summary,

27
00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:18.720
and Approve, Reject.
Role Guide 06 has their side.

28
00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:22.550
If you decide yourself instead
of sending to the board, Approve.

29
00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:25.590
Status Approved, the raiser is told,

30
00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:29.270
and Head of Talent Acquisition
launches recruitment: CV sources,

31
00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:33.070
a recruiter,
the role profile, the posting.

32
00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:36.740
The second decision,
a Hiring Approval Sheet.

33
00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:40.980
When Head of Talent Acquisition sends one,
an email arrives,

34
00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:45.700
CHRO Approval Required,
with the HAS number.

35
00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:50.500
The link opens the twelve-column sheet:
candidate, post,

36
00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:54.620
unit, education, experience,
last organization, proposed salary.

37
00:02:54.970 --> 00:03:00.490
View CV opens the CV in a new tab;
the link says Personal CV or BDJobs CV.

38
00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:03.280
Read the sheet's columns once.

39
00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:09.600
Education, total experience
and last organization come from the CV,

40
00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:12.960
checked by Head of Talent Acquisition.

41
00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:17.424
The salary was fixed from the
committee's marks and the band ladder,

42
00:03:17.544 --> 00:03:19.840
after the recruiter's negotiation.

43
00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:24.600
This is the figure the board approves,
so the offer does not go beyond it.

44
00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:27.150
One decision for the whole sheet.

45
00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:33.550
To send it back, Return the
sheet with a reason, shown, Back.

46
00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:38.710
Approve all, Confirm.
The sheet now goes to the board.

47
00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:42.789
Progress shows on Head of Talent
Acquisition's Approval Sheets.

48
00:03:43.139 --> 00:03:48.679
When the board approves, the candidate's
Board Approval step in onboarding

49
00:03:48.799 --> 00:03:52.859
completes and the recruiter
sends the offer letter,

50
00:03:52.979 --> 00:03:55.749
with your name and signature.
If anyone returns it,

51
00:03:55.869 --> 00:03:59.369
the whole sheet stops, and the reason
sits on every candidate's record.

52
00:03:59.489 --> 00:04:04.869
Now the signature.
Under Profile in Settings, E-signature:

53
00:04:04.989 --> 00:04:10.489
upload a picture of your signature, JPG or
PNG, crop it three to one, Save signature,

54
00:04:10.609 --> 00:04:15.089
then Save changes.
Only you ever see this image, not even HR.

55
00:04:15.439 --> 00:04:21.239
When the recruiter builds an offer
or appointment letter,

56
00:04:21.359 --> 00:04:26.759
they pick you under Signed by, from the
CHRO holders. With a signature on file it

57
00:04:26.879 --> 00:04:30.959
is printed on the letter; without one,
a blank rule above your name and title.

58
00:04:31.309 --> 00:04:35.909
Oversight. Requisitions shows
every unit's requisitions.

59
00:04:36.349 --> 00:04:42.309
Open any pipeline. Approval Paths,
AI Settings, Board Groups are

60
00:04:42.429 --> 00:04:47.949
shared with Head of Talent Acquisition;
Role Guide 04 has the detail.

61
00:04:48.299 --> 00:04:52.259
Open any pipeline to see candidates,
scores, stages;

62
00:04:52.379 --> 00:04:57.779
you can do what the recruiter does,
though usually looking is enough.

63
00:04:57.899 --> 00:05:02.779
Employees holds your own record,
designation, unit, as synced from ZingHR.

64
00:05:03.129 --> 00:05:08.530
You are told when a requisition
reaches you, and sheets come by email.

65
00:05:09.529 --> 00:05:12.409
Keep Email notifications on in Settings.

66
00:05:12.759 --> 00:05:16.879
Under the Notifications tab in Settings,
Email notifications

67
00:05:16.999 --> 00:05:22.439
turns your own email on or off. Sheet
emails are outside it; they always come.

68
00:05:22.789 --> 00:05:28.669
Questions.
Why no Send to CHRO on my level?

69
00:05:29.109 --> 00:05:34.909
You are the CHRO;
on your level it is Send to Board.

70
00:05:35.669 --> 00:05:39.269
Approve some on a sheet and not others?
No, one decision per sheet;

71
00:05:39.389 --> 00:05:42.939
return it with a reason and Head of
Talent Acquisition builds a new one.

72
00:05:43.059 --> 00:05:49.019
In short. A requisition:
the Approvals tab, Approve, Reject,

73
00:05:49.139 --> 00:05:54.091
Need more info, or Send to Board.
A sheet: the emailed link,

74
00:05:54.211 --> 00:05:59.259
View CV, Approve all or Return.
Your signature in Settings.

75
00:06:00.018 --> 00:06:04.579
The full guide is a PDF under Tutorials.
Thank you.

